select 'Dinovember Game Night','Manteca Library dinosaur-themed games and trivia for children ages 6–12. The library lists November 17, 2026, 3:30–4:30 PM, at 320 W. Center Street. Check the official library page for any participation updates before attending. Source checked November 6, 2026; no library artwork or event photos reused.','Manteca','Manteca Branch Library, 320 W. Center Street','2026-11-17T15:30:00-08:00'::timestamptz,'2026-11-17T16:30:00-08:00'::timestamptz,'Seasonal celebrations','https://www.ssjcpl.org/events-services/events-calendar/manteca-branch/dinovember-game-night','HIGH','approved','editorial_seasonal_2026',1.0,false,'approved'
